  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: GoodMoniHH
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Are the others doing alright?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267874930425931
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: Last I saw of Sayori and Yuri, they safely arrived to Winterhold town.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (And Natsuki?)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: Well... she's having a little trouble controlling her temper. Still...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267874930425933
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: Other than that, she's fine and is well on her way to joining the Companions.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267874930425934
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Good, good...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267874930425935
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (I hope you don't think I'm trying to care just because <b>you</b> want
      me to...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267874930425936
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267874930425937
    - rid: 4351267874930425938
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267874930425939
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (I've been doing some thinking...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267874930425943
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (About what <b>you've</b> said, about what that <i>thing</i> said, about
      our situation...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267874930425944
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (And...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267874930425945
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (I just kind of feel like an idiot, ahaha...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267874930425946
    - rid: 4351267874930425973
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Like, I thought since I could edit the sequences and stuff, that meant
      that the other girls couldn't be "real.")
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267874930425947
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (But here we are, a completely different world entirely, seemingly unbound
      from our previous constraints-)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267874930425948
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (With new constraints for me, because I just can't have anything nice,
      ahaha...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267874930425949
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (But the girls are still talking, still moving, still... doing things.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267874930425950
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (And if they <i>can</i> be liberated from a script...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267874930425951
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (They have to be real, right?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267874930425952
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (And that sort of...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267874930425953
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Would make me as good as the worst people in the world; being unable
      to recognize a fellow person as a person.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267874930425955
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267874930425956
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267874930425958
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
